<title>USA: Franklin Mutual's Price picks cheap shrs - Barron's.</title>
<headline>Franklin Mutual's Price picks cheap shrs - Barron's.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michael Price, president and chief executive of Franklin Mutual Advisers, gave a list of shares he finds to be undervalued as one of four top money managers interviewed in Monday's edition of Barron's, the financial weekly.</p>
<p>Price likes:</p>
<p>American Brands Inc</p>
<p>McDonnell Douglas Corp</p>
<p>Chase Manhattan Corp</p>
<p>Tenet HealthCare</p>
<p>U S West Media Group Inc  </p>
<p>Waban Inc</p>
<p>Cityscape Financial Corp</p>
<p>B.A.T Industries Plc</p>
<p>LucasVarity Plc</p>
<p>Allmerica Property and Casualty Cos Inc</p>
<p>U.S. Satellite Broadcasting Co</p>
<p>Dun &amp; Bradstreet Corp  </p>
<p>Comcast Corp</p>
<p>E.W. Scripps Co</p>
<p>Imation Corp</p>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp</p>
<p>and General Motors Corp.</p>
</text>
